+The repeated integral component list is exhaustive. For class `(2,3)` on
+`P^1 x P^1`, an integral repeated component of class `(alpha,beta)` must
+satisfy `m alpha<=2`, `m beta<=3`, `m>=2`; the only possibilities are:
